{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If you see a suitable object, approach it and grab it, check its properties and do task. Else scan the area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectLocated    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    />",
